### Cobra — Go CLI Library > `cobra.Command` — Core Command Struct

Source: https://context7.com/spf13/cobra/llms.txt

The `cobra.Command` struct is the central type in the library. Each CLI action is defined as a `*cobra.Command`, requiring a `Use` string and optionally including short/long descriptions and run functions. The `Run` function is executed when no subcommand is specified.

